---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection practices for DermaArc (dermaarc.com)."
>
  <section class="section-lg bg-canvas">
    <div class="container-text">
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span class="badge-accent mb-4 inline-block">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="font-display font-light text-ink mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px); letter-spacing: -0.96px; line-height: 1.1;">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-ink-mute font-body text-xs font-light">Last updated: October 2026 · DermaArc (dermaarc.com)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-ink-secondary font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            When you visit dermaarc.com or contact us via WhatsApp, email, or our inquiry forms, we collect the information you voluntarily provide, such as your name, clinic name, city, email address, phone number, and practice specialties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">2. How We Use Information</h2>
          <p>
            We use your information solely to respond to clinic growth inquiries, provide strategy audits, deliver our 4-Pillar patient acquisition services, and share relevant clinical marketing updates. We never sell or lease your data to third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">3. Healthcare &amp; Patient Data Protection</h2>
          <p>
            DermaArc does not store protected patient health records on our marketing servers. All lead capture workflows (such as WhatsApp routing) direct patient inquiries straight to your clinic's authorized front-desk WhatsApp and staff.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">4. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            For privacy-related inquiries, contact Sohail Ansari at <a href="mailto:official@dermaarc.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">official@dermaarc.com</a> or via phone at +91 99755 68867.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
